    <string name="pif_footer_title">Passing basic integrity</string>
    <string name="pif_footer_body">1. Tap \"Fetch Pixel Beta fingerprint\" and select a device from the available list.\n2. If no devices are found, import a working PIF config from a trusted source. Config files are not provided; you must find one yourself.\n3. Recheck your Play Integrity status.\n\nAlways delete the active configuration before loading a new one. Loading an expired PIF config will cause strong integrity via TrickyStore to fail, even with a valid keybox.</string>

